    "name": "SSTORE2",
    "natspec": "@notice Minimal SSTORE2-style bytecode storage: writes bytes as the runtime\n         code of a data contract and reads them back with `extcodecopy`.\n @dev Stored payloads are prefixed with a `STOP` byte so the data contract\n     can never be executed. Used for the onchain scheduled-calldata preimage\n     publication required by ADR 0004 [GOV-BATCH] rule 5 (ADR 0013\n     decision U5) and the onchain-bytes payload class of\n     `docs/stream-long-term-architecture.md` [LTA-CATALOGS] rule 6.",
    "range": {
      "byteLength": 2681,
      "byteStart": 573,
      "githubUrl": "https://github.com/6529-Collections/6529Stream/blob/513bd7e079eafe109df6ae1ae21bfbca6fec6786/smart-contracts/SSTORE2.sol#L11-L77",
